uct 1 deliveries land on the same days. Around days 11, 14 and 23 the arrivals plus leftover stock likely exceed capacity, and the excess product 1 is lost.\n  - Plan 1 brings in about 100 units of each product at a time. That means high holding costs and a real risk of overflow, for example around day 10.\n\n**Estimated ranking**\n1. Plans 2 and 6 – likely the best.\n2. Plan 5 – a good order size, but about 450 lost to daily fees.\n3. Plans 7, 4 and 0 – close to each other; which ones join the top half is uncertain.\n4. Plan 3 – heavy shortfalls.\n5. Plan 1 – very high holding costs and capacity risk."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5052, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5052}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-29T07:32:21.584Z", "request_id": "req_011CgW8waxvxFBzZffziw7wT"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_015iS6yVXEfbQ5EHQNHzG7rM", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgW8wbEocedMBrh4xPRne", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_015iS6yVXEfbQ5EHQNHzG7rM", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.4, 0.1, 0.85, 0.2, 0.45, 0.55, 0.85, 0.45]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_cr