idate:**\n- **2 and 6:** Lower ordering cost than the daily plans, sizes near the best level, and product 1 leftovers carry into the next 2-day cycle.\n- **0 (every 3 days, ~1.05×):** It saves about 232 in ordering against the 2-day plans. It loses about 200 in extra storage. Both products arrive on the same days. On day 14 they arrive as 76 + 100 = 176, the full warehouse, so any leftovers mean product 1 overflows and is lost. Close to the 2-day plans overall.\n- **4:** Better than plan 3, but over-ordering keeps it uncertain.\n- **1 (every 4 days, ~1.0×):** Product 1 lasts only 4 days, so nothing carries over between batches. Each cycle absorbs the full random swing as shortage or waste, plus high storage. That should cost more than the roughly 400 it saves in ordering.\n- **5 and 7 (daily):** Smaller stock saves about 400 in storage and some waste. That does not cover the extra ~800 in ordering against the 2-day plans, so both look worse."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5048, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5048}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-29T07:32:43.350Z", "request_id": "req_011CgW8zS1G6BsgSMhD3exSj"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01JCFEbVxju4JikYdeVeaugD", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgW8zSG8yNLgQujkMBaF8", "type": "mess